```
aim@aim-PowerEdge-T620:~$ oxide auth --help
Login, logout, and get the status of your authentication.

Manage `oxide`'s authentication state.

Usage: oxide auth [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  login   Authenticate with an Oxide Silo
  logout  Removes saved authentication information from profiles.
  status  Verifies and displays information about your authentication state.
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

Global Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Configuration profile to use for commands
```